# The paths a pull request needs the maintainer's label read-by-maintainer to change (#267): the
# required status maintainer-read is red on a pull request that changes one of them until the
# maintainer has set the label himself, and every new push removes it. scripts/maintainer-read.py
# reads this file from the base branch, and only the forms it documents. The workflow and the script
# are the same files as in astrapi69/mystic-crypt-ui, whose MaintainerReadCheckTest covers them.
#
# "Require review from Code Owners" is deliberately not enabled: every pull request comes from the
# account astrapi69, which is the owner named here, and GitHub does not let an author approve his
# own pull request. This file is the marking and the single list of the paths, nothing more.

# the signature code: the Ed25519, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA signers and verifiers, and the suite-dispatching Signatures
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/Ed25519Signer.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/Ed25519Verifier.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/MlDsaSigner.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/MlDsaVerifier.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/SlhDsaSigner.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/SlhDsaVerifier.java @astrapi69
/src/main/java/io/github/astrapi69/mystic/crypt/key/Signatures.java @astrapi69

# the check itself, so that a pull request cannot loosen it without the label
/.github/CODEOWNERS @astrapi69
/.github/workflows/maintainer-read.yml @astrapi69
/scripts/maintainer-read.py @astrapi69

# the hook that refuses a Claude Code session, local or in the cloud, that sets or removes the label,
# and the project settings that run it (#269). It holds back only what runs through Claude Code: a
# direct call to the GitHub API, a program the hook cannot see into, or the browser can still set
# the label. That is the known limit of the smallest form (astrapi69/mystic-crypt-ui#732, option a),
# not access control.
/scripts/no-maintainer-read-label.py @astrapi69
/.claude/settings.json @astrapi69
